## 2026-06-16: Actor prefab skin binding

### Confirmed local evidence

- `ActorSkinBinding` is added under `Assets/Game/Scripts/Level/Actor/` as a runtime `MonoBehaviour`; all DB/config/resource/instantiate work is reached from play-mode lifecycle or explicit skin refresh paths guarded by `Application.isPlaying`.
- `ActorSkinSelectionResolver` reuses the ShopPanel current-selection meaning: saved skin values match `Config.Skin.Id`, `PrefabResource`, or `SpineResource`; part prefabs resolve bare keys to `Assets/Game/Prefabs/Skins/{PrefabResource}.prefab`.
